ref="https://marketwatch.dfm.ae/" target="_blank" class="items-center justify-center hidden h-full py-1 gap-x-2 group md:flex mw-link text-brand-purple dark:text-default hover:text-primary ps-4 border-s dark:border-muted" data-v-e49469a1><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-v-e49469a1><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" class="text-muted group-hover:text-primary" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" color="currentColor" data-v-e49469a1><path d="M2.5 12c0-4.478 0-6.718 1.391-8.109S7.521 2.5 12 2.5c4.478 0 6.718 0 8.109 1.391S21.5 7.521 21.5 12c0 4.478 0 6.718-1.391 8.109S16.479 21.5 12 21.5c-4.478 0-6.718 0-8.109-1.391S2.5 16.479 2.5 12" data-v-e49469a1></path><path d="M2.5 14.5h.539c.472 0 .708 0 .914-.099c.205-.098.352-.283.647-.652L6 12l1.5 2.5L9 11l2.5 5L15 9l2 3.5l1.5-1.5l1.445 2.168c.252.378.378.567.562.681q.055.034.114.061c.198.09.425.09.879.09M15 2.5v3m0 16v-7" data-v-e49469a1></path><circle cx="15" cy="9" r="1" data-v-e49469a1></circle></g></svg><span class="uppercase font-heading rtl:font-arabic rtl:text-lg" data-v-e49469a1>Market Watch</span></a></div></div><div><div class="relative flex min-h-[300px] flex-col bg-black/80 md:min-h-[420px] dark:border-b dark:border-muted"><img width="1400" height="420" data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 768px) 400px, (max-width: 1024px) 1000px, 1400px" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_400,h_120,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 400w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_800,h_240,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 800w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_1000,h_300,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 1000w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_1400,h_420,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 1400w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_2000,h_600,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 2000w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_2800,h_840,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm 2800w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Page Hero Image" title="Hero image" class="absolute inset-0 object-cover object-center w-full h-full overflow-hidden transition-opacity duration-700 ease-out opacity-0" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,dpr_auto,g_center,w_2800,h_840,c_lfill/visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 pt-24 from-black bg-linear-to-t"><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative mt-24 mb-8 md:mt-auto md:mb-16"><!--[--><h1 class="px-6 font-light! leading-none text-white border-brand-yellow border-s-2"><!--[-->Family Businesses<!--]--></h1><!--[--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><section class="gray"><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3"><span class="block col-span-2"><!--[--><div class="max-w-5xl mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="mb-0 h2"><!--[-->The next chapter of your family business starts here.<!--]--></span><!----></div><p>For family businesses, going public is a milestone that can ensure sustainable growth and secure a legacy for generations to come. Joining the capital market can also be a path for diversifying wealth and improving access to capital. On a broader economic scale, sustainable long-term growth for family businesses is critical to both national economies in the region and the global economy. That’s where Dubai Financial Markets can help. </p><!--]--></span><span class="block col-span-1 lg:text-end"><!--[--><a href="https://assets.dfm.ae/docs/default-source/guides/dfm-family-business-booklet.pdf?sfvrsn=62d4f981_2" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-slot="base" class="rounded-md inline-flex items-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-75 aria-disabled:opacity-75 transition-colors ui-button text-sm! font-normal uppercase dark:text-white text-base gap-2 py-3 px-4 text-inverted bg-primary hover:bg-primary/75 active:bg-primary/75 disabled:bg-primary aria-disabled:bg-primary outline-primary/25 focus-visible:outline-3 dark:bg-(--color-violet-600) button"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--[-->View Guide<!--]--><!--[--><span class="iconify i-heroicons:document-text shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100 size-5" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-slot="trailingIcon"></span><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--></span></div><!--]--></div></section><section><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><div class="max-w-5xl mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="mb-0 h2"><!--[-->Benefits of listing for established companies<!--]--></span><!----></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 features-grid-two md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-8 gap-8 my-12 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><!--[--><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Enhanced credibility and corporate profile</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Connection to a diversified network of investors</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Strong corporate governance framework </p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Perpetuity for smooth generational transitions</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Access to funds </p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Increased awareness for your brand and offering</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Improved operational effectiveness</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Opportunity for shareholders to exit with price transparency</p></div><div><div class="w-16 h-1 my-8 bg-brand-green"></div><p>Assist with succession planning</p></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><!--[--><!----><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="separator" data-slot="root" class="flex items-center align-center text-center my-16 md:my-20 max-w-(--ui-container) md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto relative w-full flex-row"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><div data-slot="border" class="border-black dark:border-accented w-full border-solid border-t-[2px]"></div><!----><!----><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--><section><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><div class="max-w-5xl mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="mb-0 h2"><!--[-->Options for Listing Your Family Business <!--]--></span><span class="text-md block"><!--[-->Every business has different needs and strategies.<!--]--></span></div><div role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-orientation="horizontal" tabindex="0" data-slot="root" class="relative focus:outline-hidden"><div data-slot="viewport" class="overflow-hidden"><div data-slot="container" class="flex items-stretch flex-row -ms-4"><!--[--><div role="tabpanel" data-slot="item" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 rounded ps-4 basis-full md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-[70%]"><!--[--><div class="h-96"><div class="min-h-16 relative flex w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black"><img data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 800px" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 1w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_2,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 2w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_320,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 320w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_640,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_800,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 800w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w 1600w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Visual Image" class="absolute! h-full w-full max-h-none! max-w-none! inset-0 object-cover opacity-60 dark:opacity-60" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w"><!--[--><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-end w-full h-full"><div class="p-8 pt-24 text-white bg-linear-to-t from-neutral-900"><div class="text-white h3">Main Market</div><p>Designed for established businesses generating healthy revenue streams. You can become a publicly listed company on the Main Market while maintaining majority ownership with a low free-float percentage. This market is suitable for Mainland, Freezone-based and International companies.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><div role="tabpanel" data-slot="item" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 rounded ps-4 basis-full md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-[70%]"><!--[--><div class="h-96"><div class="min-h-16 relative flex w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black"><img data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 800px" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 1w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_2,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 2w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_320,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 320w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_640,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_800,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 800w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh 1600w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Visual Image" class="absolute! h-full w-full max-h-none! max-w-none! inset-0 object-cover opacity-60 dark:opacity-60" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh"><!--[--><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-end w-full h-full"><div class="p-8 pt-24 text-white bg-linear-to-t from-neutral-900"><div class="text-white h3">Growth Market</div><p>If you need expedited access to capital for your small business, consider our Growth Market option. Enjoy all the benefits of going public, but with an abbreviated IPO process for an accelerated path to your capital requirements.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><div role="tabpanel" data-slot="item" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 rounded ps-4 basis-full md:basis-1/2 lg:basis-[70%]"><!--[--><div class="h-96"><div class="min-h-16 relative flex w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black"><img data-nuxt-img sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 800px" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 1w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_2,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 2w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_320,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 320w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_640,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_800,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 800w, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn 1600w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt="Visual Image" class="absolute! h-full w-full max-h-none! max-w-none! inset-0 object-cover opacity-60 dark:opacity-60" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto,w_1600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn"><!--[--><div class="relative flex flex-col justify-end w-full h-full"><div class="p-8 pt-24 text-white bg-linear-to-t from-neutral-900"><div class="text-white h3">Private Market</div><p>If your business isn’t quite ready to be publicly listed, the Private Market could be the optimal stepping stone, associating your company with the credibility of Nasdaq Dubai while gearing up for an eventual IPO.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div data-slot="controls" class="mt-8"><!----><div role="tablist" aria-label="Choose slide to display" data-slot="dots" class="relative inset-x-0 -bottom-0 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><div class="grid h-full lg:grid-cols-2 rounded overflow-hidden bg-elevated dark:bg-muted"><div class="relative h-48 md:h-[300px] bg-black/90 lg:h-auto lg:min-h-96 overflow-hidden"><img width="600" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto:subject,w_600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00717_wcrbbw 1x, https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto:subject,w_1200,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00717_wcrbbw 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" class="absolute inset-0 z-0 object-cover w-full h-full overflow-hidden opacity-60" alt="decorator image" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dubaifinancialmarket/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,g_auto:subject,w_600,c_lfill/visuals/dfm-image-00717_wcrbbw"><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-full h-full"><svg class="text-brand-green absolute rtl:rotate-90" width="220" height="220" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path opacity=".56" d="M171.072 0 0 171.077l.006.005V220h48.928v-.006L220 48.929V0h-48.928Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="relative m-6 text-center text-white dark:text-light"><!--[--><!--]--></h2></div></div><div class="relative flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-12 md:p-12"><!--[--><div class="lg:p-6"><h3>Start by talking to our team and discover which listing option is right for you. </h3><p>Every company is different, so let us guide you on the best solution for your company and how you can get started.</p><a href="mailto:business@dfm.ae" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-slot="base" class="rounded-md inline-flex items-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-75 aria-disabled:opacity-75 transition-colors ui-button text-sm! font-normal uppercase dark:text-white text-base gap-2 py-3 px-4 text-inverted bg-primary hover:bg-primary/75 active:bg-primary/75 disabled:bg-primary aria-disabled:bg-primary outline-primary/25 focus-visible:outline-3 dark:bg-(--color-violet-600) button"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--[-->Get in touch<!--]--><!--[--><span class="iconify i-heroicons:envelope shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100 size-5" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-slot="trailingIcon"></span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section class="pt-0"><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><!--[--><!--]--><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 gap-y-4 lg:grid-cols-3"><span class="col-span-1 h2"><!--[--><div class="max-w-5xl mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2"><span class="mb-0 h2"><!--[-->Listing Resources<!--]--></span><!----></div><!--]--><!----></span><span class="block col-span-2"><!--[--><p>Dubai Financial Market provides listed companies with a wide range of added-value services, including:</p><ul class="bullets"><!--[--><li>Issuer Support Program</li><li>Option to raise new capital or sell existing shares through a book-building process </li><li>Customised communication plan with all stakeholders</li><li>Participation in the flagship international investor roadshows </li><li>Connect to key market participants to help you along the journey </li><li>Distribution of dividends through our unique iVestor cards</li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></span></div><!--]--></div></section><section class="py-12 gray"><div class="max-w-(--ui-container) w-full md:max-lg:max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative"><!--[--><div class="grid items-start justify-between grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-4 lg:grid-cols-8"><div class="col-span-6"><h3 class="mb-0">Are you considering going public, and does your company have growth potential?</h3></div><div class="col-span-2 lg:text-end"><a href="mailto:business@dfm.ae" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-slot="base" class="rounded-md inline-flex items-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-75 aria-disabled:opacity-75 transition-colors ui-button text-sm! font-normal uppercase dark:text-white text-base gap-2 py-3 px-4 text-inverted bg-primary hover:bg-primary/75 active:bg-primary/75 disabled:bg-primary aria-disabled:bg-primary outline-primary/25 focus-visible:outline-3 dark:bg-(--color-violet-600) button"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--[-->Get started<!--]--><!--[--><span class="iconify i-heroicons:envelope shrink-0 rtl:-scale-x-100 size-5" aria-hidden="true" style="" data-slot="trailingIcon"></span><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div><!--]--></div></section></div><footer class="md:text-[15px] font-light leading-6 text-white bg-dark dark:bg-muted/30 relative mt-auto" da