":"Total Trades","total-value":"Total Value","total-volume":"Total Volume","trades":"Trades","trading-clearing-member":"Trading & Clearing Member","trading-member":"Trading Member","trading-summary-chart":"Trading Summary Chart","type":"Type","unchanged":"Unchanged","under-cancellation":"Under Cancellation","up":"Up","upcoming":"upcoming","view-guide":"View Guide","view-offer":"View Offer","website":"Website","year":"Year","yes":"Yes"},"content-blocks":{"dfm-products":[{"desc":"Discover the region's most prominent international trading destination for equity securities.","title":"Equities"},{"desc":"Benefit from a higher-leverage investment vehicle while diversifying and hedging.","title":"Derivatives"},{"desc":"Access international capital markets with conventional bonds or tap into the world's largest centre for Sukuk listings.","title":"Sukuk & Bonds"},{"desc":"A direct opportunity to access new companies and invest with best-in-class sponsors.","title":"SPACs"},{"desc":"A popular choice for investors looking for exposure to the overall stock market with greater diversification.","title":"ETFs & Funds"},{"desc":"Add real estate exposure to your portfolio through our publicly-traded REITs.","title":"REITs"},{"desc":"Tap into a comprehensive and complementary set of indices, including the DFM General Index, DFM Shari'a Index and the S&P/ Hawkamah UAE ESG Index.","title":"Indices"},{"desc":"Access an efficient way to trade through the world's largest physically- delivered futures contract.","title":"Oil Futures"},{"desc":"Expand your investment portfolio through Dubai Gold Notes.","title":"Gold"}],"dubai-features":{"features":[{"desc1":"in attracting FDI","desc2":"in the Middle East and North Africa, with US$ 3.73B in 2021","position":"#1","source":"FDI, 2021","source-href":"https://mediaoffice.ae/en/news/2022/October/31-10/Dubai-retains-its-position-as-the-world-top-destination-for-FDI-projects","title":"Foreign Direct Investments"},{"desc1":"regionally","desc2":"","position":"#1","source":"GFCI32","source-href":"https://www.longfinance.net/programmes/financial-centre-futures/global-financial-centres-index/gfci-32-explore-the-data/gfci-32-rank/","title":"Global Financial Centres Index "},{"desc1":"globally","desc2":"","position":"#17","source":"GFCI32","source-href":"https://www.longfinance.net/programmes/financial-centre-futures/global-financial-centres-index/gfci-32-explore-the-data/gfci-32-rank/","title":"Global Financial Centres Index "},{"desc1":"of 190 countries ","desc2":"","position":"#16","source":"Ease of Doing Business Rank 2020, The World Bank","source-href":"https://archive.doingbusiness.org/en/rankings","title":"2020 Doing Business Report "},{"desc1":"Sukuk listed","desc2":"(*As of 2022)","position":"$81.2 B","title":"A Global Leader in the Islamic Economy"},{"desc1":"","desc2":"of global Sukuk issuances originate in the UAE In 2020","position":"62%","title":"A Global Leader in the Islamic Economy"}],"title":"Dubai - An investment destination"},"invest-in-dubai":{"content":"In 2020, Dubai was one of the few destinations in the world that remained largely open to visitors, ensuring vital business continuity. In addition to being a renowned tourism hotspot, Dubai is a hub for innovation, trade and banking and an epicentre for entrepreneurship, elevating the city's competitiveness to even greater heights.","subtitle":"The global destination for accelerating wealth and business","title":"Why Invest in Dubai"},"start-trading":{"desc":"No matter where you are based, you can apply to trade both DFM and Nasdaq Dubai listed securities in a few simple steps. ","steps":[{"content":"There are 3 ways you can obtain an NIN: through our DFM mobile app, by visiting the Dubai CSD Investor Affairs desk at the DFM trading floor, or through a DFM licensed brokerage.","title":"Apply for a DFM Investor Number (NIN)"},{"content":"Select and appoint a licensed broker to carry out your buying and selling transactions. \nYou may first want to contact the brokers, as each one offers different products and services.","title":"Appoint a Broker"},{"content":"Once you appoint a broker, you can start trading through the options they provide.\n\nView and track your portfolio on the DFM app or through DFM eServices.","title":"Start Trading"}],"title":"Start trading in 3 easy steps"}},"data-headers":{"1-month":"1 Month","1-week":"1 Week","3-months":"3 Months","6-months":"6 Months","52-high":"52 High","52-low":"52 Low","accrued-earning":"Accrued Earning","accrued-interest":"Accrued Interest","agm-date":"AGM Date","agmDate":"AGM Date","associated-groups":"Associated Groups","auditor":"Auditor","authorized-capital":"Authorized Capital","avl-credits":"Available Credits","best-bid":"Best Bid","best-offer":"Best Offer","bid":"Bid","bid-volume":"Bid Vol.","bids":"Bids","change":"Change","change-perc":"Change %","close":"Close","closing-nav":"Closing Nav","closing-price":"Closing Price","closing-price-gross":"Closing Price (Gross)","company-prices":"Company Prices","companyName":"Company","contract-size":"Contract Size","contracts":"Contracts","corporate-actions":"Corporate Actions","country-of-origin":"Country of Origin","coupon-dates":"Coupon Date(s)","coupon-percentage":"Coupon Percentage","currency":"Currency","current-index":"Current Index","custodian":"Custodian","daily-summary":"Daily Summary","date":"Date","date-of-listing":"Date of Listing","dfm-index":"DFM Index","dfmgi":"DFMGI","direct-deals":"Direct Deals","disclosures":"Disclosures","dividend":"Dividend","dividend-percentage":"Dividend Percentage","dividends-policy":"Dividends Policy","entitlementDate":"Entitlement Date","established":"Established","execution-price":"Execution Price","exEntitlementDate":"Ex-Entitlement Date","expiry-date":"Expiry Date","fils-per-share":"Fils Per Share","fiscal-year-end":"Fiscal Year End","foreign-investments":"Foreign Investments","fund-administrator":"Fund Administrator","fund-structure":"Fund Structure","futures":"Fu