s","symbol":"Symbol","today":"Today","top-shareholders":"Top Shareholders","trade-by-client-type":"Trade by Client Type","trade-by-nationality":"Trade by Nationality","trades":"Trades","trades-val":"Trades Value","trades-vol":"Trades Volume","trading":"Trading","trading-summary":"Trading Summary","underlying":"Underlying","underlying-security-code":"Underlying \u003cbr> Security Code","value":"Value","vintage":"Vintage","volume":"Volume","xDividendDate":"X-Dividend Date","year":"Year"},"global":{"buttons":{"applyForNin":"Apply for NIN with DFM","become-a-member":"Become a member","brokers":"View Licensed Brokers","dfmgi-futures-specification":"DFMGI Futures Specification","download-faq":"Download FAQ","downloadExcel":"Download Excel","eServices":"eServices","getInTouch":"Get in touch","goToIpoPlatform":"Go to IPO Platform","ivestorApp":"Get iVestor App","learn-more":"Learn More","mobileapp":"Get the DFM App","moreInfo":"More Info","refresh":"Refresh","search":"Search","submit":"Submit","subscribeNow":"Subscribe Now","view":"View","view-all":"View all","view-events":"View Events","view-index-rules":"View Index Rules","view-profile":"View Profile","viewLIcensedBrokers":"View Licensed Brokers","viewUpcomingIpoProspectus":"View Upcoming IPO Prospectus"},"marketstatus":["Closed","Open","Pre-Open","Pre-Close"]},"nuxtSiteConfig":{"description":"Dubai Financial Market (DFM) is The global destination for individuals and companies to accelerate their wealth and businesses with innovative products and services in conducting trading, clearing, settlement and depository of securities, in an efficient, transparent and liquid environment.","name":"Dubai Financial Market"},"stats":{"total-bonds":"USD 42.5 billion","total-sukuk":"USD 96.4 billion"},"timings":[{"end":"10:00","session":"Pre-Opening Session","start":"09:30"},{"end":"14:45","session":"Trading Session","start":"10:00"},{"end":"14:55","session":"Pre-Closing Session","start":"14:45"},{"end":"15:00","session":"Trading at last","start":"14:55"}],"benefits":{"blocks":["Enhanced credibility and corporate profile","Connection to a diversified network of investors","Strong corporate governance framework ","Perpetuity for smooth generational transitions","Access to funds ","Increased awareness for your brand and offering","Improved operational effectiveness","Opportunity for shareholders to exit with price transparency","Assist with succession planning"],"title":"Benefits of listing for established companies"},"cta1":{"desc":"Every company is different, so let us guide you on the best solution for your company and how you can get started.","title":"Start by talking to our team and discover which listing option is right for you. "},"listing-process":{"desc":"We will guide you through the various stages of the listing process, from the pre-IPO stage all the way to post-IPO support. ","overview":{"bullets":["Minimum AED 25M paid up capital","Minimum 2 years of financial track record","Flexible free float requirement","Appointment of a financial institution as the Listing Advisor"],"title":"Overview"},"title":"Listing process & requirements"},"listing-resources":{"blocks":["Issuer Support Program","Option to raise new capital or sell existing shares through a book-building process ","Customised communication plan with all stakeholders","Participation in the flagship international investor roadshows ","Connect to key market participants to help you along the journey ","Distribution of dividends through our unique iVestor cards"],"desc":"Dubai Financial Market provides listed companies with a wide range of added-value services, including:","titlle":"Listing Resources"},"markets":{"blocks":[{"content":"Designed for established businesses generating healthy revenue streams. You can become a publicly listed company on the Main Market while maintaining majority ownership with a low free-float percentage. This market is suitable for Mainland, Freezone-based and International companies.","img":"visuals/dfm-image-013149_begl1w","title":"Main Market"},{"content":"If you need expedited access to capital for your small business, consider our Growth Market option. Enjoy all the benefits of going public, but with an abbreviated IPO process for an accelerated path to your capital requirements.","img":"visuals/dfm-image-00308_xdaljh","title":"Growth Market"},{"content":"If your business isn’t quite ready to be publicly listed, the Private Market could be the optimal stepping stone, associating your company with the credibility of Nasdaq Dubai while gearing up for an eventual IPO.","img":"visuals/dfm-image-013147_vkddvn","title":"Private Market"}],"desc":"No two companies are alike. That’s why we offer a range of solutions designed to suit companies of any sector, size or location.","subtitle":"Every business has different needs and strategies.","title":"Options for Listing Your Family Business"},"page-intro":{"btn-label":"Discover DFM","desc":"For family businesses, going public is a milestone that can ensure sustainable growth and secure a legacy for generations to come. Joining the capital market can also be a path for diversifying wealth and improving access to capital. On a broader economic scale, sustainable long-term growth for family businesses is critical to both national economies in the region and the global economy. That’s where Dubai Financial Markets can help. ","title":"The next chapter of your family business starts here."},"page-meta":{"desc":"Going public can ensure sustainable growth and secure a legacy. DFM supports family businesses through the listing journey.","image":"visuals/famliy-business-hero_oysbvm","title":"IPO Listings for Family Businesses"},"page-title":"Family Businesses"};</script><script nonce="qOhqXr5xftVQLtf1sjPBgzcd" type="application/json" data-nuxt-data="nuxt-app" data-ssr="true" id="__NUXT_DATA__">[["ShallowReactive",1],{"data":2,"state":4,"once":25,"_errors":26,"serverRendered":11,"path":28},["ShallowReactive",3],{},["Reactive",5],{"$si18n-locale":6,"$si18n-route-params":7,"$si18n-missing-handler":8,"$scolor-mode":9,"$snuxt-seo-utils:routeRules":13,"$sstockslite":8,"$slatestPressReleases":8,"$ssite-bootstrap-ready":12,"$ssite-bootstrap-polling-bound":12,"$stoasts":14,"$sdfmgi":8,"$ssite-config":15},"en",{},null,{"preference":10,"value":10,"unknown":11,"forced":12},"light",true,false,{"head":-1,"seoMeta":-1},[],{"_priority":16,"currentLocale":20,"defaultLocale":20,"description":21,"env":22,"indexable":11,"name":23,"url":24},{"env":17,"url":18,"name":19,"description":19,"indexable":18,"currentLocale":19},-15,-3,-2,"en-US","Dubai Financial Market (DFM) is The global destination for individuals and companies to accelerate their wealth and businesses with innovative products and services in conducting trading, clearing, settlement and depository of securities, in an efficient, transparent and liquid environment.","production","Dubai Financial Market","https://www.dfm.ae",["Set"],["ShallowReactive",27],{"symbol-search-stocks-en":-1,"$f121407s6m5egt":-1},"/raise-capital/ipo-listings/family-businesses"]</script></body></html>